  "details": "<p>The Barrington Atlas Directory notes: Bing\u00f6l Da\u011f</p>",
  "review_state": "published",
  "type": "FeatureCollection",
  "description": "The modern Bing\u00f6l Da\u011flar\u0131 is an extinct shield volcano located to the northeast of modern Bing\u00f6l in Turkey, lying between the modern settlements of Karl\u0131ova, Tekman, H\u0131n\u0131s, and Varto. The mountain was known in Roman times by the name \"Abos\".",
